quotes:
The complaint alleges that throughout the Class Period, Defendants failed to disclose to investors that:
(1) a significant portion of the Company’s sales of servers were to companies based in China;
(2) these transactions violated U.S. export control laws;
(3) there were material weaknesses in the Company’s controls to ensure compliance with applicable export control laws and regulations; and
(4) that, as a result of the foregoing, Defendants’ positive statements about the Company’s business, operations, and prospects were materially misleading and/or lacked a reasonable basis.
